      "page": 130,
      "ruku": 103,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 810,
      "text": "Who does greater wrong than one who fabricates lies against Allah or rejects His verses? The wrongdoers will never succeed.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 21,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 130,
      "ruku": 104,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 811,
      "text": "On the Day when We will gather them all together, then We will say to those who associated partners with Allah, “Where are your partners whom you claimed [to be equal to Allah]?”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 22,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 130,
      "ruku": 104,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 812,
      "text": "Then they will have no excuse but to say, “By Allah, our Lord, we never associated any partners [with Allah][6].”",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 23,
      "juz": 7,
      "manzil": 2,
      "page": 130,
      "ruku": 104,
      "hizbQuarter": 52,
      "sajda": false
    },
    {
      "number": 813,
      "text": "See how they will lie against themselves, and all what they used to fabricate will vanish from them.",
      "surah": {
        "number": 6,
        "name": "سُورَةُ الأَنۡعَامِ",
        "englishName": "Al-An'aam",
        "englishNameTranslation": "The Cattle",
        "numberOfAyahs": 165,
        "revelationType": "Meccan"
      },
      "numberInSurah": 24,
      "juz": 7,
